Stardew Valley Expanded adds 3 new farm animals to the game that are available to purchase from [[Stardew:Marnie's Ranch|Marnie's Ranch]] once their respective conditions are met.

{{Info|For clarity, vanilla game mechanics can be reviewed at: [[Stardew:Animals|Stardew Valley wiki - Animals]].}}

Farm animals added by the mod will live in one of two newly added buildings: the [[Premium Barn]] or the [[Premium Coop]].

